[ti:Unbound]
[ar:Giuntru]
[re:Automatic line alignment - listening review pending]
[00:13.58]They drew our hearts in patterns old
[00:16.86]Stitched fate in silver threads of gold
[00:18.78]They said desire was blood and bone
[00:20.74]A silent script we couldn’t own
[00:22.62]But something broke along the line
[00:24.64]Your warmth turned shadow into shine
[00:26.50]You lit the pulse beneath my skin
[00:28.56]A rising truth I’ve never been
[00:30.46]If truth is just a note they tried to bind
[00:33.84]I’ll let it shift to clarity in my mind
[00:38.46]I am unbound
[00:40.98]No strings around my breath tonight
[00:43.64]Love isn’t coded in the bone
[00:45.80]It’s in the glow we pull from light
[00:47.76]If the world draws borders in the dark
[00:50.14]I’ll cross them bright I’ll cross them sharp
[00:52.20]I’m unbound
[00:57.80]A rising fire in your spark
[01:14.92]They carved our choices into vows
[01:16.58]Said hearts were clocks allowed to bow
[01:18.48]But I have seen the hidden wells
[01:20.36]The ways that break the ways that tell
[01:22.36]Your skin reshaped my inner tones
[01:24.20]Rewrote the scale beneath my bones
[01:26.18]You cut the thread you freed the sound
[01:28.20]And every chord in me unwound
[01:30.30]If fate was just a map they pinned in fear
[01:33.94]I’ll bend the notes and draw you near
[01:37.50]I am unbound
[01:40.68]No shadows tied to where I move
[01:43.18]Love isn’t written like a rule
[01:45.48]It’s in the heat our bodies prove
[01:47.38]If the night pulls tight around our name
[01:49.80]I’ll lift it up I’ll change its frame
[01:51.90]
[01:53.42]I’m unbound
[01:57.02]And burning into flame
[02:01.24]Cut the script they handed me
[02:05.00]The one that claimed my symmetry
[02:06.98]I’m more than cells or legacy
[02:08.70]I’m breath I’m pulse I’m alchemy
[02:10.54]No shape can tell me who to be
[02:12.80]No rule owns how you move through me
[02:14.74]If love is wild electricity
[02:16.20]I’ll ride the spark they couldn’t see
[02:19.12]
[02:21.98]Unbound unmade
[02:24.08]Your light against my shade
[02:26.08]If freedom has a sound
[02:27.82]It’s the note that lifts your name
[02:29.72]Unbound I rise again in flame
